<BaseLayout title="Fiction — Alex Franquelli" description="Fiction by Alex Franquelli, including an untitled science-fiction novel in progress.">
  <div class="simple">
    <div class="eyebrow">Fiction</div>
    <h1>Untitled novel</h1>
    <p>A philosophically driven science-fiction novel, currently at the end of its third draft.</p>
    <p>I am keeping the description deliberately spare while the manuscript is still moving: enough to say what kind of book it is, without reducing it to a plot summary before the final shape is settled.</p>
    <div class="fiction-meta">
      <div><span>Form</span><strong>Novel</strong></div>
      <div><span>Status</span><strong>End of third draft</strong></div>
    </div>
    <p>For fiction enquiries, <a class="text-link" href="/contact">get in touch ↗</a>.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
